---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="The Future of Activewear: Fabric Innovations to Watch in 2026"
  description="Explore the next generation of technical textiles. From biodegradable fibers to intelligent thermal regulation, learn what drives the high-end fitness market."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Textile Innovation</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">The Future of <span class="text-accent italic">Technical Activewear</span></h1>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 19, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>10 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">In the premium market, you are not selling clothes—you are selling technology. Here are the three innovations defining high-end activewear in 2026.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. Bio-Based Synthetic Fibers</h2>
      <p>The move away from petroleum-based polyester is accelerating. We are now integrating <strong>Corn-based Polyamide</strong> and <strong>Sugarcane-derived Nylon</strong>. These fibers offer identical performance metrics to traditional synthetics but with a significantly lower carbon footprint. For high-end US brands, these "Advanced Bio-Synthetics" are the new benchmark for luxury athleisure.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Intelligent Thermal Regulation</h2>
      <p>Our new <strong>ThermaSense™ technology</strong> uses encapsulated phase-change materials that absorb heat during high-intensity training and release it during recovery. This "smart" fabric management is a major selling point for $100+ retail leggings, providing a tangible performance benefit that customers can feel.</p>

      <div class="bg-gray-100 p-10 rounded-[40px] my-12 text-center">
        <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-4 uppercase">R&D Roadmap 2026:</h4>
        <p class="text-sm italic text-gray-500">Currently in development: 100% Biodegradable Elastane and Graphene-infused compression layers for enhanced oxygen delivery.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Zero-Microplastic Filtration</h2>
      <p>With new regulations in the European Union, large-scale importers are looking for "Low-Shed" fabrics. We've optimized our knitting and finishing processes to reduce microplastic shedding during home washing by up to 60%. This technical superiority is becoming a mandatory requirement for large-scale procurement in the EU market.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Invest in Innovation</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Connect with our R&D team to explore exclusive fabric development for your brand.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Speak to R&D</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
